# Web Hosting - Static Source Code (GitHub Pages)
GitHub Pages serves as the static hosting platform for the Noble Architecture Project Admin & Documentation System Core App.

## Core Principle
GitHub Pages mirrors the local directory structure, providing predictable URLs that correspond directly to local file paths.

## Hard Constraints
- GitHub Pages is **Read-Only at runtime** - it cannot be written to by the application or users.
- Hosts only static source code and assets - no dynamic, user-generated content.
- Local directory structure must mirror the deployed GitHub Pages structure for predictable development and deployment.
- Dynamic content must never be written to or stored in GitHub Pages (see rule 11 for Cloudflare R2 dynamic storage).

---

# GitHub Pages - Three Key Hosted Locations
GitHub Pages hosts three primary locations, each with a corresponding local path and GitHub Pages URL:

## 1. Core App Code
The main application source code for the Project Admin & Documentation System.

**Local Path:**
`D:\WE10_--_Public-Repo_--_Live-Website\na-apps\10__NaProjectAdmin__DocumentSystem__CoreAppCode\` 

**GitHub Pages URL:**
`https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/10__NaProjectAdmin__DocumentSystem__CoreAppCode/`

**Path Mapping Example:**

**Local file:**
`D:\WE10_--_Public-Repo_--_Live-Website\na-apps\10__NaProjectAdmin__DocumentSystem__CoreAppCode\index.html`

**GitHub Pages URL:**
`https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/10__NaProjectAdmin__DocumentSystem__CoreAppCode/index.html`

---

## 2. Common Assets (Shared Across Apps)

Shared resources including fonts, graphics, and icons used across multiple Noble Architecture applications.

**Local Path:**
`D:\WE10_--_Public-Repo_--_Live-Website\na-apps\01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets\`

**GitHub Pages URL:**
`https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-apps/01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets/`

**Asset Loading:**
Assets are loaded dynamically via the `CommonUtils__AssetLoader__.js` module, which resolves absolute GitHub Pages URLs from configuration. This ensures CORS-free asset loading in both development and production.

**Asset Structure:**
```
01__Assets__NaApps__CommonAssets/
├── NaApps__CommonFonts/          (Loaded dynamically by AssetLoader)
├── NaApps__CommonGraphics/       (Referenced via AssetLoader API)
└── NaApps__CommonIcons/          (Auto-updated by AssetLoader)
```

---

## 3. Project Portal (Static Project Files)

Contains project-specific files. **Note:** This location contains both static files (served from GitHub Pages) and dynamic files (served from Cloudflare R2 CDN).

**Local Path:**
`D:\WE10_--_Public-Repo_--_Live-Website\na-project-portal\`

**GitHub Pages URL:**
`https://www.noble-architecture.com/na-project-portal/`

**Important:** Dynamic project files created by users are stored in Cloudflare R2 and served from:
`https://cdn.noble-architecture.com/NaProjectPortal/26-Projects/[ProjectCode]/[path]/[dynamic-file].json`

See rule 11 (Web Hosting and Storage Boundary) for complete details on dynamic content storage.

